Defines the number of intermediate solution steps which shall be saved before the integration interval is covered\&. The storage for these steps is allocated correspondingly\&. The solver attempts to distribute the save steps evenly over the timespan of interest\&. 
.br

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIs\fP The number of steps which shall be saved\&. 
.RE
.PP

