.SS "void csmp::ODE_StiffSolver::OutputResultsTo (const char * textfile) const"
Writes the results of a calculation to a user-defined textfile with the extension '\&.txt'\&. Each line will give the timestep and the values of each dependent variable\&. The output may be corrupted when not enough savesteps were specified to accurately portray the system behaviour\&.

.PP
